WEBVTT

00:08:57.241 --> 00:09:00.119
to avoid transportation costs
and emissions.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.663
It needs to be residual biomass

00:09:02.663 --> 00:09:05.583
so it does not require
additional land to grow it.

00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:11.213
Most biochar companies today
use wood residues,

00:09:11.255 --> 00:09:13.215
like sawdust or branches,

00:09:13.257 --> 00:09:14.758
to produce biochar.

00:09:14.758 --> 00:09:17.177
But many alternatives exists --

00:09:17.177 --> 00:09:19.680
in particular, agricultural residues.

00:09:20.014 --> 00:09:24.893
Two, we need superefficient,
24-7 production systems.

00:09:25.519 --> 00:09:27.187
The technology exists,

00:09:27.187 --> 00:09:29.148
but there's still room for improvement.

00:09:29.898 --> 00:09:31.150
And three,